+/* thumbnails in the parts drawer (zoomed to ~.4). The compartment is 71-77px wide, so the title column held only 26-41px of
+   content at 14px type. "ADDER" (54px) plus the 28px icon overflowed it, and flex centering pushed the overflow out on
+   both sides, so the icon slid under the text. In the drawer the pin letters go (5px once zoomed, unreadable; the brass
+   screws stay), which gives the plate the whole middle of the box. The title is larger, and the icon stacks above it
+   (flex-wrap) whenever icon and title don't fit side by side. The plate screws move to the top corners. */
